<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-007" chapter-id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao" source-id="s-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao">
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:mucampaign" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三年春正月，平南將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:mucampaign:m0010" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>帥師救京師，次於尋陽，遣督護<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:mucampaign:m0026" ref="dhx_wp0_d3a">王愆期</persName>、西陽太守<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:mucampaign:m0034" ref="cws_842_o4u">鄧嶽</persName>、鄱陽太守<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:mucampaign:m0041" ref="8x8_lf1_wwn">紀睦</persName>爲前鋒。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:appointment" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">平南將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:appointment:m0004" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>爲驃騎將軍、開府儀同三司，封始安郡公。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">夏四月乙未，驃騎將軍、始安公<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin067-wenqiao:death:m0014" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>卒。</p>
</text>
